### Raw SOAP calls (VS Code REST Client). Replace the account number after CreateAccount.
@base = http://localhost:3000/soap/bank
@account = 1234567890

### Get the WSDL contract
GET {{base}}?wsdl

### CreateAccount
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: text/xml; charset=utf-8
SOAPAction: "http://example.com/bank/CreateAccount"

<?xml version="1.0"?>
<soap:Envelope xmlns:soap="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/" xmlns:bank="http://example.com/bank">
  <soap:Body>
    <bank:CreateAccountRequest>
      <bank:ownerName>Asha Verma</bank:ownerName>
      <bank:currency>INR</bank:currency>
    </bank:CreateAccountRequest>
  </soap:Body>
</soap:Envelope>

### GetAccount
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: text/xml; charset=utf-8
SOAPAction: "http://example.com/bank/GetAccount"

<?xml version="1.0"?>
<soap:Envelope xmlns:soap="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/" xmlns:bank="http://example.com/bank">
  <soap:Body>
    <bank:GetAccountRequest><bank:accountNumber>{{account}}</bank:accountNumber></bank:GetAccountRequest>
  </soap:Body>
</soap:Envelope>

### Deposit
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: text/xml; charset=utf-8
SOAPAction: "http://example.com/bank/Deposit"

<?xml version="1.0"?>
<soap:Envelope xmlns:soap="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/" xmlns:bank="http://example.com/bank">
  <soap:Body>
    <bank:DepositRequest>
      <bank:accountNumber>{{account}}</bank:accountNumber>
      <bank:amount>1500.75</bank:amount>
    </bank:DepositRequest>
  </soap:Body>
</soap:Envelope>

### Withdraw (try a huge amount to see a soap:Fault)
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: text/xml; charset=utf-8
SOAPAction: "http://example.com/bank/Withdraw"

<?xml version="1.0"?>
<soap:Envelope xmlns:soap="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/" xmlns:bank="http://example.com/bank">
  <soap:Body>
    <bank:WithdrawRequest>
      <bank:accountNumber>{{account}}</bank:accountNumber>
      <bank:amount>500.25</bank:amount>
    </bank:WithdrawRequest>
  </soap:Body>
</soap:Envelope>
